<title>JAPAN: Thai finance minister to meet BOJ, Sakura Bank.</title>
<headline>Thai finance minister to meet BOJ, Sakura Bank.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Finance Minister Thanong Bidaya will meet with Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita and Sakura Bank Ltd officials during his visit to Japan next week, a Thai embassy official in Tokyo said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
